00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:29.280
and everything is working.

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:35.090
And if it detects that
the VM is reporting 500,

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:36.860
or the applications
stop responding,

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:37.890
it will recreate it.

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:41.150
We can also look how
autohealing is set up.

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:43.520
So we go into the Cloud Console.

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:44.540
Health Checks.

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:46.000
We have an autohealing.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:48.320
So as you can see,
we are looking

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:51.200
at the path health, so,
the same as I showed you

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:53.010
before in the application.

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:54.620
It's using protocol
HTTP, but you

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:59.920
can use TCP, HTTPS, SSL
on any port you want.

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:02.470
You need to specify
